          <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>01</Text></Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>课程知识库</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>PDF / DOCX / TXT / MD 上传解析，分块入 Chroma；sha256 去重，删除同步清向量，分块可预览。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 568, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, paddingTop: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>02</Text></Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>分层教学引擎</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>六类问题自动分类，两种模式，L1→L4 四级提示；服务端跳级钳制与答案泄露护栏。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 176, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 568, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, paddingTop: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>03</Text></Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>截图报错分析</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>本地 OCR / 视觉模型双通道；识别文字可编辑后重跑，复用同一套检索与教学链路。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 568, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, paddingTop: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>04</Text></Box>
